  "textNodes": [
    {
      "id": "f_msha5ev8_fok0q3",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "",
      "textPos": "bottom",
      "audioFile": null,
      "target": "f_msha5ev8_fok0q3"
    },
    {
      "id": "f_msha5ev7_t8rks3",
      "speaker": "我",
      "text": "一场婚礼，就拍四张照片，这报酬足够我的照相馆继续经营下去……",
      "textPos": "bottom",
      "audioFile": null,
      "target": "f_msha5ev7_t8rks3"
    },
    {
      "id": "f_msha5ev8_igfwzk",
      "speaker": "我",
      "text": "不过这沈家子时结婚，倒也是头一次见。",
      "textPos": "bottom",
      "audioFile": null,
      "target": "f_msha5ev8_igfwzk"
    },
    {
      "id": "f_msha5ev8_c20fw6",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "",
      "textPos": "bottom",
      "audioFile": null,
      "target": "f_msha5ev8_c20fw6"
    },
    {
      "id": "f_msha5ev8_h13qqa",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "",
      "textPos": "bottom",
      "audioFile": null,
      "target": "f_msha5ev8_h13qqa"
    },
    {
      "id": "f_msha5ev8_nmjz1o",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "",
      "textPos": "bottom",
      "audioFile": null,
      "target": "f_msha5ev8_nmjz1o"
    },
    {
      "id": "f_msha5ev8_s2tdci",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "",
      "textPos": "bottom",
      "audioFile": null,
      "target": "f_msha5ev8_s2tdci"
    },
    {
      "id": "f_msha5ev8_qa8vv7",
      "speaker": "管家",
      "text": "先生，吉时快到了，怎么还不进门",
      "textPos": "bottom",
      "audioFile": null,
      "target": "f_msha5ev8_qa8vv7"
    },
    {
      "id": "f_msha5ev8_trqbwc",
      "speaker": "管家",
      "text": "今天一共4张照片，每拍完一张照片就给你一部分报酬",
      "textPos": "bottom",
      "audioFile": null,
      "target": "f_msha5ev8_trqbwc"
    },
    {
      "id": "f_msha5ev8_rpyi00",
      "speaker": "管家",
      "text": "第一张迎宾照，镜头对准条案",
      "textPos": "bottom",
      "audioFile": null,
      "target": "f_msha5ev8_rpyi00"
    },
    {
      "id": "f_msha5ev8_aog2d0",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "",
      "textPos": "bottom",
      "audioFile": null,
      "target": "f_msha5ev8_aog2d0"
    },
    {
      "id": "f_msha5ev8_sk4q34",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "",
      "textPos": "bottom",
      "audioFile": null,
      "target": "f_msha5ev8_sk4q34"
    },
    {
      "id": "f_msha5ev8_iac0ix",
      "speaker": "管家",
      "text": "且慢，这···这里原本我们主家的牌位哪去了，先生帮我找一下。",
      "textPos": "bottom",
      "audioFile": null,
      "target": "f_msha5ev8_iac0ix"
    },
    {
      "id": "f_msha5ev8_y8kiwn",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "",
      "textPos": "bottom",
      "audioFile": null,
      "target": "f_msha5ev8_y8kiwn"
    },
    {
      "id": "f_msha5ev8_emv5iv",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "",
      "textPos": "bottom",
      "audioFile": null,
      "target": "f_msha5ev8_emv5iv"
    },
    {
      "id": "f_msha5ev8_bwgll4",
      "speaker": "我",
      "text": "肉眼看不见的东西，全被这台相机拍了下来",
      "textPos": "bottom",
      "audioFile": null,
      "target": "f_msha5ev8_bwgll4"
    },
    {
      "id": "f_msha5ev8_rb4y7x",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "",
      "textPos": "bottom",
      "audioFile": null,
      "target": "f_msha5ev8_rb4y7x"
    },
    {
      "id": "f_msha5ev8_yffo5l",
      "speaker": "我",
      "text": "这场婚宴，似乎早就替我留好了位置",
      "textPos": "bottom",
      "audioFile": null,
      "target": "f_msha5ev8_yffo5l"
    },
    {
      "id": "f_msha5ev8_l2fg1h",
      "speaker": "管家",
      "text": "先生请随我来，我们去内堂稍作休息",
      "textPos": "bottom",
      "audioFile": null,
      "target": "f_msha5ev8_l2fg1h"
    },
    {
      "id": "f_msha5ev8_777x34",
      "speaker": "我",
      "text": "这些人影看上去……好像纸人",
      "textPos": "bottom",
      "audioFile": null,
      "target": "f_msha5ev8_777x34"
    },
    {
      "id": "f_msha5ev8_zgooh7",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "",
      "textPos": "bottom",
      "audioFile": null,
      "target": "f_msha5ev8_zgooh7"
    },
    {
      "id": "f_msha5ev8_uljfni",
      "speaker": "我",
      "text": "不能再往前走了，灯笼上的黄符破损，必须赶紧修复它",
      "textPos": "bottom",
      "audioFile": null,
      "target": "f_msha5ev8_uljfni"
    },
    {
      "id": "f_msha5ev8_ahpbqg",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "",
      "textPos": "bottom",
      "audioFile": null,
      "target": "f_msha5ev8_ahpbqg"
    },
